  "description": "<p>You bear a scrap of paper inscribed with an arbiter's blessing.</p><ul><li><p>You are immune to <strong>Sleep</strong>, and cannot lose consciousness by any means short of death.</p></li><li><p>You can take a <strong>Long Rest</strong> without falling asleep.</p></li><li><p>You suffer a <strong>-1</strong> dice penalty to all <strong>Willpower</strong> checks for each day you go without sleep.</p></li></ul>",
